      r: ['Correct. A fluid order needs the fluid, the rate and any additives; “keep the vein open” alone is incomplete.', 'Incorrect. The nurse can’t supply a missing rate.', 'Incorrect. That guesses at a rate that may overload the client.', 'Incorrect. Clarify before giving it.'],
      ask: 'What does a complete fluid order contain?', cues: ['No rate'],
