      r: ['Correct. Limit attempts to two per clinician, then escalate.', 'Incorrect. More attempts hurt and raise infection risk.', 'Incorrect. That is still a third attempt.', 'Incorrect. A more skilled clinician, ultrasound or another route may still work.'],
      ask: 'How many tries does one clinician get?', cues: ['Two unsuccessful attempts'],
