      r: ['Correct. A 20 g suits all therapies, including blood, in a suitable forearm vein.', 'Incorrect. Small and slow for blood, and hand veins are a poor choice.', 'Incorrect. Far larger than needed (more phlebitis) and at a joint of flexion.', 'Incorrect. The palm side of the wrist risks the median nerve.'],
