      r: ['Correct. No BP cuff on an arm with any catheter.', 'Incorrect. The cuff squeezes the whole vein, not just the site.', 'Incorrect. Even brief pressure can cause leaking or damage.', 'Incorrect. Any cuff on that arm is the problem.'],
      ask: 'What does a cuff do to the vein holding the catheter?', cues: ['PICC arm', 'BP cuff'],
