      r: ['Correct. Check every container for cracks or pinholes and every fluid for cloudiness, particles or an odd color.', 'Incorrect. A filter doesn’t make a contaminated bag safe.', 'Incorrect. Particles suggest contamination or a precipitate.', 'Incorrect. Prevention beats detection.'],
      ask: 'Is this fluid safe to infuse?', cues: ['Particles in the bag'],
