      o: ['Air embolism and bleeding from a disconnection', 'Phlebitis', 'Speed shock', 'Infiltration'], a: [0],
      r: ['Correct. A slip-tip held with tape can separate; an open central line can draw in air.', 'Incorrect. Not the main danger of a loose connection.', 'Incorrect. That comes from a drug given too fast.', 'Incorrect. Infiltration is a peripheral tip leaving the vein.'],
